{"hymn":"S873","parent":"E1050","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"De mi tristeza y oscuridad","subtitle":"El evangelio—Venir al Señor","syl":{"n1":"De","n2":"mi","n3":["tris","i"],"n4":["te","m"],"n5":["za","t"],"n6":["y‿os","i"],"n7":["cu","m"],"n8":["ri","m"],"n9":["dad,","t"],"n10":["¡Ven","i"],"n11":["go,","t"],"n12":["Je","i"],"n13":["sús!","t"],"n14":["¡Ven","i"],"n15":["go,","t"],"n16":["Je","i"],"n17":["sús!","t"],"n18":"A","n19":"Tu","n20":["a","i"],"n21":["le","m"],"n22":["grí","m"],"n23":["a‿y","t"],"n24":["cla","i"],"n25":["ri","m"],"n26":["dad,","t"],"n27":["¡Ven","i"],"n28":["go,","t"],"n29":["Je","i"],"n30":["sús,","t"],"n31":"a","n32":"Ti!","n35":"De","n36":"mi","n37":["do","i"],"n38":["len","m"],"n39":["cia‿a","t"],"n40":"Tu","n41":["sa","i"],"n42":["ni","m"],"n43":["dad,","t"],"n44":"De","n45":"mi","n46":["pe","i"],"n47":["ca","m"],"n48":["do,‿a","t"],"n49":"Tu","n50":["san","i"],"n51":["ti","m"],"n52":["dad,","t"],"n53":"De","n54":"mi","n55":["ca","i"],"n56":["ren","m"],"n57":["cia","t"],"n58":"a","n59":"Tu","n60":["cau","i"],"n61":["dal,","t"],"n62":["¡Ven","i"],"n63":["go,","t"],"n64":["Je","i"],"n65":["sús,","t"],"n66":"a","n67":"Ti!"},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["De mi fracaso, pena y dolor,","¡Vengo, Jesús! ¡Vengo, Jesús!","Para en Tu cruz hallar mi valor,","¡Vengo, Jesús, a Ti!","De mi lamento a Tu confortar,","De mi tormenta a Tu dulce paz,","De mi angustia a Tu bienestar,","¡Vengo, Jesús, a Ti!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["De la inquietud y vana altivez,","¡Vengo, Jesús! ¡Vengo, Jesús!","Quiero Tu voluntad complacer,","¡Vengo, Jesús, a Ti!","Salgo del yo y entro en Tu amor,","De depresión a expectación,","Como las águilas vuelo yo,","¡Vengo, Jesús, a Ti!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Del gran terror que la tumba da,","¡Vengo, Jesús! ¡Vengo, Jesús!","Para en Tu gozo poder entrar,","¡Vengo, Jesús, a Ti!","De esa ruina en que estaba yo,","A Tu rebaño lleno de amor,","Tu faz gloriosa miraré yo,","¡Vengo, Jesús, a Ti!"]}]